              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, heavy armour, composite bow and kontos. Rides a horse which may have half barding (+2). Army General. Used to Elephants</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
